# The root .gitignore excludes *.log and dev.log, which silently kept
# eval/fixtures/dev.log out of the repo for the whole build: score.py defaults
# --log here, found nothing, printed "NOT MEASURED" and exited 0, so nothing
# ever complained. This fixture is a committed, generated artifact (see
# README.md and eval/make_dev_log_fixture.py) and must be in the tree.
!dev.log
